The <computeroutput>is_floating_point</computeroutput> concept is satisfied when <computeroutput>T</computeroutput> is one of the standard floating point types (<computeroutput>float</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>double</computeroutput>, or <computeroutput>long double</computeroutput>). It is the primary definition; <computeroutput>is_floating_point_v</computeroutput> is derived from it for use in <computeroutput>if constexpr</computeroutput> and non-concept contexts. </para>
